1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:00,828
Mars,

2
00:00:00,828 --> 00:00:02,559
yang dikira planet mati...

3
00:00:02,559 --> 00:00:05,174
ternyata membocorkan gas khas gunung api!

4
00:00:05,174 --> 00:00:06,369
Di Alba Mons,

5
00:00:06,369 --> 00:00:09,925
gunung api terluas di Mars yang
sudah tidur miliaran tahun.

6
00:00:09,925 --> 00:00:12,380
Wahana Eropa mencium hidrogen klorida,

7
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,581
tepat di atas retakan-retakan segar.

8
00:00:14,581 --> 00:00:16,773
Zat yang sama dengan asam lambung kita!

9
00:00:16,773 --> 00:00:17,855
Artinya...

10
00:00:17,855 --> 00:00:19,022
di bawah sana,

11
00:00:19,022 --> 00:00:20,555
mungkin masih ada magma.

12
00:00:20,555 --> 00:00:21,947
Dan kata peneliti,

13
00:00:21,947 --> 00:00:25,287
retakan itu tempat yang masuk
akal untuk mencari kehidupan!

14
00:00:25,287 --> 00:00:26,152
Menurutmu,

15
00:00:26,152 --> 00:00:28,335
Mars masih hidup atau sudah mati?

16
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:29,964
Tulis di komentar!
